{"id":"elspeth-beard","title":"Elspeth Beard: Lone Rider","who":"Elspeth Beard","when":"1982–1984","vehicle":"BMW R60/6","kind":"moto","color":"#4338ca","media":[{"kind":"book","title":"Lone Rider","by":"Elspeth Beard"}],"summary":"An architecture student takes a break from her studies and rides an old BMW round the world alone, about 35,000 miles: North America, Australia, Southeast Asia, India in the turmoil after Indira Gandhi's assassination, Pakistan and back through Turkey. Accidents, theft and forged permits along the way; nobody paid attention when she got home, until her book.","sources":[{"label":"Wikipedia: Elspeth Beard","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elspeth_Beard"}],"approximate":"Places named in accounts of the trip; the roads are approximate.","km":41390,"bbox":[-178.6439,-33.8698,179.6049,51.5113],"stops":[{"name":"New York","place":"New York City","at":[40.7127,-74.006],"date":"1982","text":"The bike shipped over from Britain; the start."},{"name":"Canada","place":"Toronto, Canada","at":[43.6535,-79.3839],"text":"North into Canada."},{"name":"Mexico","place":"Mexico City","at":[19.3208,-99.1515],"text":"South to Mexico, then back to the US."},{"name":"Los Angeles","place":"Los Angeles, California","at":[34.0537,-118.2428],"text":"The bike shipped on to Australia."},{"name":"Sydney","place":"Sydney, Australia","at":[-33.8698,151.2083],"text":"Out of money: seven months working in a pub.","by":"boat"},{"name":"Townsville","place":"Townsville, Queensland","at":[-19.2569,146.824],"text":"A crash and two weeks in hospital."},{"name":"Darwin","place":"Darwin, Northern Territory","at":[-12.4604,130.841],"text":"Across the top of Australia."},{"name":"Singapore","place":"Singapore","at":[1.3571,103.8195],"text":"Six weeks replacing stolen documents and gear.","by":"unknown"},{"name":"Thailand","place":"Bangkok, Thailand","at":[13.7525,100.4935],"text":"Up through Malaysia and Thailand."},{"name":"Punjab","place":"Amritsar, India","at":[31.6357,74.8787],"text":"Punjab closed after Indira Gandhi's assassination; she forged a permit to get out.","by":"unknown"},{"name":"Pakistan","place":"Lahore, Pakistan","at":[31.5657,74.3142],"text":"Into Pakistan."},{"name":"Turkey","place":"Istanbul, Turkey","at":[41.0064,28.9759],"text":"West across Iran and Turkey to Europe."},{"name":"London","place":"London, UK","at":[51.5074,-0.1278],"date":"1984","text":"Home after about 35,000 miles: one of the first Englishwomen round the world by motorcycle."}],"legs":[{"by":"ride","km":759,"line":[[40.7121,-74.0057],[40.7258,-74.0076],[40.7409,-74.0669],[40.7533,-74.1948],[40.858,-74.3631],[40.8689,-74.458],[40.9105,-74.507],[40.8901,-74.6858],[40.9256,-74.787],[40.9277,-75.0898],[40.9973,-75.145],[40.9788,-75.1979],[40.987,-75.2356],[41.0124,-75.2981],[41.0561,-75.3197],[41.0698,-75.3902],[41.1445,-75.4034],[41.2392,-75.5105],[41.3995,-75.5843],[41.4761,-75.6816],[41.5301,-75.6526],[41.6277,-75.6432],[41.6816,-75.6882],[41.7018,-75.6689],[41.7638,-75.6866],[41.8548,-75.6841],[41.8737,-75.7204],[42.0032,-75.7535],[42.0214,-75.783],[42.0942,-75.8127],[42.1082,-75.8367],[42.1201,-75.9792],[42.0595,-76.1366],[42.091,-76.1712],[42.0804,-76.2088],[42.1017,-76.2543],[42.0795,-76.3072],[42.0251,-76.3542],[42.0282,-76.4432],[42.0088,-76.463],[42.0003,-76.5155],[42.0017,-76.6172],[42.0226,-76.6565],[42.027,-76.7159],[42.0774,-76.774],[42.1544,-76.8101],[42.1617,-76.852],[42.1186,-77.01],[42.1625,-77.0595],[42.1533,-77.0869],[42.1757,-77.1083],[42.1884,-77.1577],[42.2912,-77.2252],[42.3369,-77.3346],[42.3764,-77.3587],[42.4453,-77.4711],[42.5099,-77.5159],[42.5416,-77.5757],[42.5327,-77.673],[42.5809,-77.7419],[42.6775,-77.8178],[42.6989,-77.8574],[42.7563,-77.8847],[42.7393,-78.1899],[42.7706,-78.3313],[42.7676,-78.5923],[42.7941,-78.6009],[42.7987,-78.6352],[42.8286,-78.6762],[42.8501,-78.7892],[42.8758,-78.7895],[42.8736,-78.8585],[42.9062,-78.9007],[42.9179,-78.9663],[43.038,-79.1188],[43.1228,-79.1211],[43.1523,-79.1509],[43.1797,-79.264